            <div class="mySlides">
                <div class="numbertext">1 / 4</div>
                <div class="bio-info-page">
                    <img src="/pub/media/wysiwyg/BOO-PROFILE-PIC.jpg" alt="Bhupinder (Boo) Dhaliwal" />
                </div>
                <div class="bio-details">
                    <h3>Bhupinder (Boo) Dhaliwal</h3>
                    <h4>GPhC 2050963</h4>
                    <div class="sep-line"></div>
                    <div class="bio-details-cont">
                        <p>
                            Boo's journey in pharmacy began with a strong foundation. He graduated with a degree in pharmacy from Aston University in 1999, followed by achieving registration as a pharmacist with the General Pharmaceutical Council. Fuelled by a desire to make a tangible impact on people's health, he didn't waste time acquiring his first independent community pharmacy. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            This marked the beginning of a successful venture. Today, Boo, alongside his partners, manages over 20 Pharmacies across England. This thriving network serves as a testament to his dedication to delivering exceptional in-person care to communities nationwide. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Always one to embrace innovation, Boo recognised the potential of the digital age to further improve healthcare accessibility. This foresight led to the creation of Pharmacy Planet, an online pharmacy built upon the same principles of trust and expertise that have always defined his approach. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            While medications are his professional focus, Boo's commitment to well-being extends beyond the pharmacy counter. He prioritises a healthy lifestyle, balancing work with gym sessions and enjoying rounds of golf. This active approach reflects the holistic view he strives to embody in his work. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Boo's extensive experience in both traditional and online pharmacy management allows him to lead the Pharmacy Planet team with a unique perspective. His leadership ensures patients receive consistent, high-quality care.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="mySlides">
                <div class="numbertext">2 / 4</div>
                <div class="bio-info-page">
                    <img src="/pub/media/wysiwyg/JAMES-PROFILE-PIC.jpg" alt="James Batson" />
                </div>
                <div class="bio-details">
                    <h3>James Batson</h3>
                    <div class="sep-line"></div>
                    <div class="bio-details-cont">
                        <p>
                            James's passion for pharmacy blossomed early, taking root during his teenage years working in a small regional Australian pharmacy. These formative experiences instilled in him a profound understanding of the essence of patient care within the pharmacy setting. This early exposure wasn't a fleeting interest; it ignited a lifelong dedication that fuelled James's pursuit of extensive experience across diverse pharmacy environments.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            His distinguished career stretches over decades, where he meticulously navigated the intricacies of retail, hospital, and community pharmacy settings. This breadth of experience has transformed him into a highly regarded authority figure. James possesses an unparalleled understanding of the multifaceted needs patients face and the distinct ways pharmacies can cater to them. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Today, James leverages his vast knowledge and experience to serve as the central conductor of Pharmacy Planet's complex operations. He coordinates all aspects of the company, ensuring it runs like a well-oiled machine. Under his masterful leadership, Pharmacy Planet has earned a reputation for delivering exceptional service. This exceptional service is built upon a deep understanding of the nuances of pharmaceutical care, ensuring patients receive the precise level of attention and support they deserve. 
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="mySlides">
                <div class="numbertext">3 / 4</div>
                <div class="bio-info-page">
                    <img src="/pub/media/wysiwyg/JEN-PROFILE-PIC.jpg" alt="Jenomi Thuduwage" />
                </div>
                <div class="bio-details">
                    <h3>Jenomi Thuduwage</h3>
                    <div class="sep-line"></div>
                    <div class="bio-details-cont">
                        <p>
                            Jenomi has been with Pharmacy Planet since its pioneering days. She began with Pharmacy Planet as an operational assistant, where she meticulously prepared medications for patients and ensured their orders were packaged with the utmost care. This hands-on experience instilled in her an intimate understanding of the intricate processes required to safely supply medicine. 
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Jenomi's dedication and talent didn't go unnoticed, and over time, her expertise and commitment to excellence propelled her through the ranks. Today, she leads Pharmacy Planet's customer service team, ensuring patients receive exceptional care and clear communication throughout their experience. Her deep understanding of operations, coupled with her unwavering focus on customer satisfaction, makes her an invaluable asset. Jenomi's leadership also extends to the weight loss clinic, where she plays a crucial role in its day-to-day operations, guaranteeing a seamless and supportive experience for patients on their wellness journeys. 
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>



            <div class="mySlides">
                <div class="numbertext">4 / 4</div>
                <div class="bio-info-page">
                    <img src="/pub/media/wysiwyg/TAM-PROFILE-PIC.jpg" alt="Tamana Panesar" />
                </div>
                <div class="bio-details">
                    <h3>Tamana Panesar</h3>
                    <div class="sep-line"></div>
                    <div class="bio-details-cont">
                        <p>
                            Tamana's journey in pharmacy began long before joining Pharmacy Planet in 2023. Her roots lie in the heart of the community, where she honed her skills working in a local pharmacy. This experience instilled in her a deep understanding of the unique needs and challenges faced by patients daily. In 2023, Tamana brought her passion and expertise to Pharmacy Planet's customer service team. 
                        </p>
                        <p>
                           Since then, Tamana has thrived in building strong relationships with patients. Her friendly and approachable demeanour creates a trusting environment where patients feel comfortable discussing their healthcare concerns. Tamana doesn't just answer questions; she goes the extra mile to truly understand each patient's situation. This dedication has allowed her to facilitate personalised solutions for thousands of patients, ensuring they receive the support and guidance they need. Her cheery disposition and willingness to go above and beyond are not just personality traits; they're the hallmarks of a trusted advisor who genuinely cares about patient well-being. This combination of expertise, empathy, and a commitment to exceptional service has made Tamana a highly valued member of the Pharmacy Planet team, someone patients can rely on for support and navigation through their healthcare journey. 
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="mySlides">
                <div class="numbertext">5 / 4</div>
                <div class="bio-info-page">
                    <img src="/pub/media/wysiwyg/ayesha.png" alt="Ayesha Patel" />
                </div>
                <div class="bio-details">
                    <h3>Ayesha Patel</h3>
                    <h3>MPharm (Hons), IPresc</h3>
                     <h4>GPhC 2079407</h4>
                    <div class="sep-line"></div>
                    <div class="bio-details-cont">
                        <p>
                            Ayesha Patel is a highly skilled and dedicated pharmacist with extensive experience in community pharmacy management. Registered with the General Pharmaceutical Council (GPhC), she has demonstrated her commitment to patient care and clinical excellence throughout her career. Ayesha holds a Master of Pharmacy (MPharm) degree from Portsmouth University, where she developed a strong foundation in pharmaceutical science, clinical therapeutics, and patient care. Her academic achievements reflect her dedication to mastering the complexities of pharmacy, from the precise science of medicine formulation to the compassionate delivery of healthcare services.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Building on this strong academic foundation, Ayesha pursued further professional development by completing her qualification as an Independent Prescriber in 2018 at Keele University. This prestigious qualification has significantly enhanced her ability to provide patient-centred care, empowering her to conduct focused consultations and develop individualised care plans tailored to each patient’s unique needs. Her experience working closely with other healthcare professionals has further refined her expertise in safe, evidence-based prescribing practices, including medication reviews, chronic disease management, and optimising patient outcomes.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                           Throughout her career, Ayesha has excelled in pharmacy management, where she has consistently led teams to deliver exceptional results. Her patient-focused approach, combined with her proactive leadership style, has consistently resulted in high levels of customer satisfaction and retention. Her ability to adapt to diverse and dynamic environments ensures that patients receive the highest standard of care.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                           Ayesha is fluent in English and Gujarati, which has proven invaluable in providing clear and compassionate care to patients from various backgrounds. Her dedication to patient well-being, combined with her clinical expertise as an Independent Prescriber, makes her a valuable asset to Pharmacy Planet’s clinical team, where she continues to deliver safe, effective, and personalised healthcare.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="mySlides">
                    <div class="numbertext">6 / 4</div>
                    <div class="bio-info-page">
                        <img src="/pub/media/wysiwyg/HARMY-PROFILE-PIC.jpg" alt="Harminder ‘Harmy’ Kaur" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="bio-details">
                        <h3>Harminder ‘Harmy’ Kaur</h3>
                        <h4>GPhC 2061107</h4>
                        <div class="sep-line"></div>
                        <div class="bio-details-cont">
                            <p>
                              Harmy stands out as a highly experienced pharmacist with a unique blend of expertise. She is both a seasoned community pharmacist and a clinical services pharmacist. This dual qualification allows her to bridge the gap between community settings and specialised clinical care, providing a holistic understanding of patient needs. 
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                Harmy's career has been driven by a particular interest in weight loss medicine. This passion has led her to work with patients across a wide array of healthcare settings, from community pharmacies to specialised clinics.This diverse experience has equipped her with an in-depth understanding of the challenges and opportunities associated with weight management.Moreover, it has fuelled her dedication to developing and implementing innovative new clinical and patient care services.Harmy is a recognised expert in creating programmes that empower patients on their weight loss journeys. 
                            </p>

                            <p>
                                Harmy brings her wealth of experience and innovative spirit to Pharmacy Planet's weight loss clinic. She leverages her clinical services expertise to provide patients with personalised guidance and support.Through her insightful consultations and advice, Harmy empowers patients to make informed decisions and achieve their weight loss goals.Her dedication fosters a trusting environment where patients feel comfortable discussing their concerns and receive the comprehensive support they deserve. 
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <div class="mySlides">
                <div class="numbertext">7 / 4</div>
                <div class="bio-info-page">
                    <img src="/pub/media/wysiwyg/WLImage/gurdev-sehmi-img.jpg" alt="Gurdev Sehmi" />
                </div>

                <div class="bio-details">
                    <h3>Gurdev Sehmi</h3>
                    <h4>GPhC 2050925</h4>
                    <div class="sep-line"></div>
                    <div class="bio-details-cont">
                        <p>
                            Gurdev's journey in pharmacy began with academic excellence. He graduated in 1999 from Aston University, laying a strong foundation for his future success. Following graduation, Gurdev embarked on a rewarding career path as a community pharmacist. For decades, he has diligently served patients, fostering a deep understanding of their needs and the vital role community pharmacies play in their well-being. This wealth of experience has positioned Gurdev as a respected leader within the pharmacy community. 
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Gurdev's leadership extends far beyond his practice. He has drawn upon his experience to oversee the operations of the dozens of community pharmacies belonging to the Pharmacy group. This impressive network is a testament to his expertise and his dedication to fostering excellence within the industry. Gurdev's leadership has undoubtedly played a significant role in shaping the success of these pharmacies and ensuring they deliver exceptional patient care. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Gurdev's commitment to the profession extends beyond managing pharmacies.  At Pharmacy Planet, he serves as the superintendent pharmacist. In this pivotal role, Gurdev spearheads the company's professional governance and carefully oversees all aspects of Pharmacy Planet's practice, ensuring strict adherence to the high standards set by professional regulatory bodies. Gurdev's unwavering commitment safeguards patient safety and fosters trust within the healthcare community. His leadership ensures Pharmacy Planet remains at the forefront of ethical and compliant practices. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Gurdev's dedication to patient well-being is further amplified by his qualification as a Pharmacist Independent Prescriber. This advanced qualification allows him to take on a more prominent role in patient care, directly contributing to improved health outcomes. Gurdev's ability to prescribe medications independently empowers him to work collaboratively with other healthcare professionals, streamlining the treatment process and optimising patient care. 
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>


            

            <div class="mySlides">
                <div class="numbertext">8 / 4</div>
                <div class="bio-info-page">
                    <img src="/pub/media/wysiwyg/Unknown_person.jpg" alt="Manesha Thuduwage" />
                </div>
                <div class="bio-details">
                    <h3>Manesha Thuduwage</h3>
                    <!-- <h4>Bsc.Pharm,PgDipIP, MRPharmS</h4> -->
                    <div class="sep-line"></div>
                    <div class="bio-details-cont">
                        <p>
                            Manesha is a recognised authority within Pharmacy Planet, having been with the company since its very inception. Her experience stretches back to the company's birth, where she played a pivotal role in establishing the core processes and systems that revolutionised pharmaceutical healthcare delivery. Manesha wasn't simply present at the forefront of this innovation; she was instrumental in shaping it.Her fingerprints are on the foundational elements that allow Pharmacy Planet to deliver medication in entirely new ways. 
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Through her dedication and tenure within Pharmacy Planet, Manesha has cultivated an unparalleled understanding of pharmacy service processes.Her expertise goes beyond mere familiarity; she possesses a keen eye for improvement and a deep understanding of how new technologies can empower better patient care.Manesha recognises the immense potential of the online space to cater to the vast and diverse needs of patients.This recognition fuels her constant drive to innovate and develop creative solutions. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Manesha leverages her in-depth understanding of Pharmacy Planet's inner workings to spearhead the development of the company's website and internal systems. Under her leadership, these systems continuously evolve, adapting to the ever-changing needs of both patients and the healthcare industry as a whole. Manesha's expertise ensures that Pharmacy Planet remains at the forefront of innovation, consistently implementing creative solutions to address global patient challenges. 
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            

            
            

            

            <div class="mySlides">
