                <div class="bio-details">
                    <h3>Keshav ‘Kesh’ Sharma</h3>
                    <h4>GPhC 2076168</h4>
                    <div class="sep-line"></div>
                    <div class="bio-details-cont">
                        <p>
                           Kesh boasts over a decade of experience as a trusted community pharmacist. Throughout his career, he has honed his expertise in both NHS and private settings, giving him a well-rounded understanding of the diverse needs patients face. This extensive experience positions him perfectly to oversee Pharmacy Planet's dispensary operations, ensuring the highest standards of accuracy and efficiency. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Kesh's dedication goes beyond technical expertise. He is driven by a genuine interest in health and fitness, which aligns perfectly with Pharmacy Planet's core mission: empowering patients to achieve optimal health. This passion fuels his commitment to ensuring every patient receives the medication and guidance they need to thrive. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            His meticulous nature and deep understanding of regulations are invaluable assets. He meticulously oversees Pharmacy Planet's dispensary operations, guaranteeing strict adherence to all relevant guidelines. This unwavering commitment to compliance fosters a safe and trustworthy environment for both patients and staff. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Kesh's extensive experience allows him to anticipate potential challenges within the dispensary and implement proactive solutions. This foresight ensures a smooth and efficient medication dispensing process, minimising delays and maximising patient satisfaction. His approachable demeanour further strengthens trust with patients, creating a comfortable space for them to ask questions and receive clear guidance. 
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mySlides">
                <div class="numbertext">10 / 4</div>
                <div class="bio-info-page">
                    <img src="/pub/media/wysiwyg/Unknown_person.jpg" alt="Heather Ward" />
                </div>
                <div class="bio-details">
                    <h3>Heather Ward</h3>
                    <h4>GPhC 5105186</h4>
                    <div class="sep-line"></div>
                    <div class="bio-details-cont">
                        <p>
                            Heather's dedication to pharmacy began at a young age, embarking on her career path at the promising age of 19. This early foray into the field ignited a passion that has fueled her for many years. Her extensive
                            experience encompasses a diverse range of pharmacy environments, allowing her to develop a well-rounded understanding of the intricacies involved.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            A significant portion of Heather's career has been dedicated to working within the demanding yet crucial environment of hospital dispensaries and laboratories. These settings require meticulous attention to
                            detail and a deep understanding of safe medication handling practices. Heather's years of experience in these high-pressure environments have honed her expertise in ensuring the utmost accuracy and safety in
                            medication dispensing.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Heather's commitment to excellence is further underscored by her qualification as a Pharmacy Technician. This rigorous training equips her with a comprehensive knowledge base and the skills necessary to navigate
                            the complexities of pharmacy operations. As a valued member of Pharmacy Planet's dispensary team, Heather uses her expertise to facilitate the safe and accurate supply of medications to our patients. Her
                            dedication plays a vital role in ensuring patients receive the precise medication they need, fostering trust and promoting optimal health outcomes.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
