            <div class="mySlides">
                <div class="numbertext">11 / 4</div>
                <div class="bio-info-page">
                    <img src="/pub/media/wysiwyg/Unknown_person.jpg" alt="Kiloran ‘Kiki’ Clark" />
                </div>
                <div class="bio-details">
                    <h3>Kiloran ‘Kiki’ Clark</h3>
                    <div class="sep-line"></div>
                    <div class="bio-details-cont">
                        <p>
                            Kiki's journey in pharmacy is a testament to her unwavering dedication to the field. Her experience in Pharmacy spans numerous years, and ultimately lead her to become a qualified dispenser. This qualification
                            signifies her in-depth understanding of safe medication handling and dispensing procedures, ensuring patients receive the correct medication in the prescribed manner.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Prior to returning to pharmacy with renewed zeal, Kiki spent a significant portion of her career honing her stock management skills within the demanding world of high-end retail. These years of experience
                            instilled in her a meticulous approach to organization and inventory control, skills that are highly transferable to the world of pharmacy dispensing. Kiki's ability to manage stock efficiently translates to a
                            smoother and more streamlined medication dispensing process for Pharmacy Planet.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            After a hiatus from pharmacy, Kiki returned to the field with a newfound passion for dispensary operations. This renewed enthusiasm fuels her commitment to ensuring the safe and accurate supply of medications at
                            Pharmacy Planet. Her dedication plays a vital role in fostering trust with patients and guaranteeing they receive their medications without delays or errors. Kiki's combined experience and renewed zeal make her a
                            valuable asset to our dispensary team.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mySlides">
                <div class="numbertext">12 / 4</div>
                <div class="bio-info-page">
                    <img src="/pub/media/wysiwyg/Unknown_person.jpg" alt="Amardeep Sehmi" />
                </div>
                <div class="bio-details">
                    <h3>Amardeep Sehmi</h3>
                    <h4>GPhC 2077030</h4>
                    <div class="sep-line"></div>
                    <div class="bio-details-cont">
                        <p>
                            Amardeep is a highly respected pharmacist with extensive experience honed within the demanding environment of hospital pharmacy. Amardeep graduated with a master's degree in pharmacy from Medway School of Pharmacy in 2010, solidifying her foundation in pharmaceutical knowledge. Her dedication to continuous learning is further evidenced by her diploma in clinical pharmacy in 2013 from Keele University. These years of experience have developed her clinical knowledge base thoroughly, equipping her with a deep understanding of complex medical conditions and medication interactions. This expertise positions her as a valuable asset within the healthcare field, particularly in situations requiring a meticulous and knowledgeable approach. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                           Amardeep's dedication to patient well-being is most evident in her experience as an ICU pharmacist. In this critical setting, she plays a vital role in delivering effective patient outcomes for some of the sickest patients. Her keen eye for detail, combined with her in-depth clinical knowledge, allows her to optimise medication regimens and ensure patients receive the precise treatment they need to recover. Amardeep's unwavering commitment contributes significantly to improved patient outcomes within the ICU. 
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            AAmardeep's qualifications extend beyond her impressive hospital pharmacy experience.  Having achieved her qualification as a Pharmacist Independent Prescriber from the University of Herefordshire in 2022, this additional expertise empowers her to utilise her extensive clinical knowledge and experience to directly benefit Pharmacy Planet's patients. Amardeep's ability to independently prescribe medications allows for a more personalised approach to care, ensuring patients receive the most effective treatment plans possible. 
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mySlides">
